# Production build: fully disable MSW mocking (see src/main.tsx) — this app is served from
# the same origin as the real backend (no CORS middleware anywhere, by design — see
# docs/frontend_README.md), so no VITE_API_BASE_URL is needed either; every fetch is already
# same-origin relative (/v1, /admin, /oauth).
#
# Pages with no real backend yet (dashboard summary tiles, KRA-call timeseries chart,
# outbox/sync-lag summary, alert rules, global audit log — see frontend_README.md's
# "What's real vs. mocked" table) will error against the live backend until those endpoints
# exist. That's expected, not a build bug.
VITE_ENABLE_MOCKS=false
